    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d879">

                <pb facs="1118" n="1106" xml:id="pg1106"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">892.014/12–2146: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Minister in Siam</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Stanton</hi>)<anchor n="28"
                        xml:id="d879-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1946-12-26T14:00:00-05:00">December 26, 1946—2
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>969. Reurtel 1400, Dec. 21; Paris 6229, Dec. 23 to Dept<anchor n="29" xml:id="d879-f2"/> repeated unnumbered to
                    Bangkok. Dept expressed concern<anchor n="30"
                        xml:id="d879-f3"/> French Emb Siamese Leg
                    over delay establishment Conciliation Commission. Prince Wan expressed
                    determination have Amer on Commission and have Commission convene New York.
                    Siamese probably will not hold out for Brit and Chinese members but Prince Wan
                    indicated Siamese will force issue in favor Amer as according General Act if no
                    agreement possible on three neutral members each side then selects one and the
                    two selected in turn select one neutral.</p>
                <p>Inform FonOffs Bangkok and Paris Dept’s concern over delay indicating immaterial to
                        Dept nationality of neutrals and place of
                    convening.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d879-f1" n="28" type="source" xml:id="d879-f1-content">
                <p>This telegram was repeated to Paris as No. 6591 and to London as No. 8300.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d879-f2" n="29" xml:id="d879-f2-content">
                <p>Neither printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d879-f3" n="30" xml:id="d879-f3-content">
                <p>On December 24.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
